# Nothing but what the image needs.
#
# This lives on `main` now, beside a repository with a test suite, a benchmark
# and eight translations of the documentation — none of which belongs in a
# build context. The image installs Comodor from PyPI, so the only thing that
# has to travel is the start script.
*
!Dockerfile
!docker/start
# A wheel the build just produced, for a rehearsal that installs it
# instead of asking PyPI (`--build-arg COMODOR_WHEEL=<name>`).
!dist/*.whl
